WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.800
In an emergency, the right support can change everything.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.800
A patient arrives. Three qualified doctors. One decision: who should respond?

3
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:17.800
Behind each wristband is a different story. Heart rate. Variability. Movement.

4
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:25.800
NeuraSign turns those signals into estimates of stress, fatigue, workload and readiness.

5
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:32.800
Omar is already busy. Emma shows elevated fatigue. Maya is available and ready.

6
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:40.800
The incident reaches NeuraSign. It compares the team’s signals, availability and relevant skills.

7
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:48.800
Maya is the recommended match. You see who, and the reasons behind the recommendation.

8
00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:55.800
The coordinator confirms. Maya gets the alert, and moves straight to the patient.

9
00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:00.700
This hospital is just one example.

10
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:10.800
NeuraSign is designed for demanding workplaces with real risks. Construction sites. Industrial operations. Control rooms.

11
00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:15.700
NeuraSign. Understand your team. Respond with confidence.
